<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Renong three-mth net up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Renong three-mth net up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 78.95	    vs	    71.81</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 3.8	     vs	     4.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		 193.40	     vs	   118.35</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 102.96	     vs	   103.05</p>
<p>    Minorities   (less)    8.28	     vs (less)   15.80</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  2.02	     vs	     0.69</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	 nil	     vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Renong Bhd. It is an infrastructure development conglomerate, with interests in construction, engineering and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
